<!--
  Pitviper.

  The venomous snake of the helium mines; the first thing a helldiver learns to
  fear, and the thing that kills the careless before the gas does. A native
  hazard for the helium barrens, with a stray chance on the terraformed steppe so
  reclaimed ground is not entirely safe either.

  STRUCTURE. ThingDef on AnimalThingBase and PawnKindDef on AnimalKindBase, the
  vanilla parents every Alpha Animals creature uses (Races_BloodShrimp.xml,
  Races_Skyeel.xml - the latter is the snake-bodied one, on the vanilla "Snake"
  body with a "Mouth" attack group, both mirrored here). Life stages, litter
  curve, lifeStageAges and the sound fields are from the same files.

  THE BITE is a four-def chain, each in its vanilla folder:

    ToolCapacityDef  RR_PitviperBite   (ToolCapacityDefs/ToolCapacities_RimRising.xml)
    ManeuverDef      RR_PitviperBite   (ManeuverDefs/Maneuvers_RimRising.xml)
    DamageDef        RR_PitviperBite   (DamageDefs/Damages_RimRising.xml)
    HediffDef        ToxicBuildup      (vanilla Core)

  Capacity -> maneuver -> damage -> hediff. Mirrored from Alpha Animals'
  AA_ToxicBite, which uses the same chain against its own buildup hediff. This
  one lands on vanilla ToxicBuildup, scaled by the victim's ToxicResistance, so
  anything already tox-resistant shrugs it off - and a later Red gene with a
  ToxicResistance offset would make Reds the people who survive the mines, for
  free. (Alpha Genes puts statOffsets/ToxicResistance on a GeneDef, so that is a
  verified field; the gene is not added here because its icon would need a glyph
  recipe in New-XenotypeIcons.ps1, which owns UI/Icons/Genes.)

  GRAPHICS. Pawn body graphics are directional - <leaf>_east, _north, _south -
  and the graphicClass is declared explicitly inside bodyGraphicData so that
  Test-ModDefs.ps1 and New-PlaceholderTextures.ps1, which read the class from
  the sibling node, treat the path as a directional set rather than a single
  file. Vanilla animal defs leave it implicit; the explicit form is the same
  GraphicData field and changes nothing in game.

  TEXTURES NEEDED (placeholder script generates them from these paths):
    Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper_{east,north,south}
    Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper_Dessicated_{east,north,south}

  NUMBERS. Body size 0.25 and a 0.5 health scale: a small animal that dies to one
  good hit and is dangerous only because it bites first. The bite itself is
  modest (7) - the venom is the weapon. Wildness 0.9 and trainability None: not a
  pet, not a prospect. Predator with a tiny prey ceiling, so it hunts rats and
  nothing larger, and will not stalk colonists the way a cougar does; a pawn gets
  bitten by stepping on one or hunting it. All relative to the Alpha Animals
  reference values for small creatures, not measured against vanilla's cobra,
  which this session could not read.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RR_Pitviper</defName>
    <label>pitviper</label>
    <description>A slender, heat-loving snake that nests in the warm cracks of a helium seam and in the rubble around a shaft head. Its venom works fast and its colour matches the rock, which is the whole of its strategy.\n\nEvery mine clan has a word for the sound a pitviper makes just before it strikes, and every clan teaches it to children before they can walk. The lesson does not always take.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>4.2</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>5</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>60</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>90</MarketValue>
      <FilthRate>1</FilthRate>
      <Wildness>0.9</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>fangs</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>RR_PitviperBite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>7</power>
        <cooldownTime>1.6</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Mouth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>head</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Blunt</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>2</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>true</ensureLinkedBodyPartsGroupAlwaysUsable>
        <chanceFactor>0.2</chanceFactor>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>Snake</body>
      <predator>true</predator>
      <maxPreyBodySize>0.3</maxPreyBodySize>
      <herdAnimal>false</herdAnimal>
      <baseBodySize>0.25</baseBodySize>
      <baseHungerRate>0.12</baseHungerRate>
      <baseHealthScale>0.5</baseHealthScale>
      <foodType>CarnivoreAnimal, OvivoreAnimal</foodType>
      <leatherDef>Leather_Lizard</leatherDef>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <petness>0</petness>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0.4</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0.6</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <gestationPeriodDays>22</gestationPeriodDays>
      <litterSizeCurve>
        <points>
          <li>(0.5, 0)</li>
          <li>(1, 1)</li>
          <li>(3, 1.7)</li>
          <li>(5, 0.7)</li>
          <li>(6, 0)</li>
        </points>
      </litterSizeCurve>
      <lifeExpectancy>9</lifeExpectancy>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalBaby</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.2</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>AnimalAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.4</minAge>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalUncommon</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RR_Pitviper</defName>
    <race>RR_Pitviper</race>
    <label>pitviper</label>
    <combatPower>20</combatPower>
    <ecoSystemWeight>0.3</ecoSystemWeight>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.7</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper_Dessicated</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.7</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper_Dessicated</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>1.3</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
        <dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RR_Pitviper/RR_Pitviper_Dessicated</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>1.3</drawSize>
        </dessicatedBodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
